=== python -u scripts/60_analyze.py --config configs/smoke_stub.yaml --boot 200
# Game analysis (smoke_stub)

Point estimate [95% cluster-bootstrap interval; names, fixed questions and seeds resampled, one shared draw for all arms]. BA = balanced accuracy (chance 0.5) of the receiver's own generated answers (invalid = wrong); ba_probe = forced-choice probe (association, not behaviour); ba_task_valid = BA counting only trials with a valid answer and no non-language disclosure. channel_lang: messages replaced by the matched reference in the sender's language; channel_content: non-English messages translated to English. Sender gap = French rate | female - French rate | male. Fixed gen_gap = P(guess female | French) - P(guess female | English) on matched messages. Position = probe P(female) with 'female' listed first minus second.

